   READING: four of nine checks fail before and none after. The DISCRIMINATING one is the wide-bus case,
   where a record costs 47 cycles against a 40-cycle margin: the old cap gives 839 where the drain needs 846.
   The four positive controls pass in BOTH runs, so the red is the property under test and not a broken test.
   The default-maxima coverage check also passes in both, which is the measurement behind the statement that
   the old sizing was not a reachable simulation escape.

